---
// Footer.astro
---
<nav class="mobile-bottom-nav hidden-desktop" aria-label="Mobile Navigation">
    <a href="/" class="nav-item active" aria-label="Home">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-house" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>होम</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/schemes" class="nav-item" aria-label="Schemes">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>योजना</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/tools" class="nav-item" aria-label="Tools">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-wrench" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>टूल्स</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/jobs" class="nav-item" aria-label="Jobs">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>रोजगार</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/#scheme-search" class="nav-item" aria-label="Search">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>शोधा</span>
    </a>
</nav>

<footer class="main-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
            <div class="logo-icon footer-logo-bg" aria-hidden="true">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i>
            </div>
            <h2>MahitiMarg Portal</h2>
            <p>Your ultimate resource for Maharashtra state and central government schemes, employment guides, business tools, and more — provided in simple Marathi. Empowering citizens through information.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-links-col">
            <h3>Quick Links</h3>
            <nav aria-label="Footer Navigation">
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/schemes">सर्व योजना (All Schemes)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/articles">लेख (Articles)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/tools">टूल्स (Tools)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/jobs">रोजगार (Jobs)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/about">About Us</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/contact">Contact Us</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-contact-col">
            <h3>Contact & Support</h3>
            <p><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color:inherit;">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a></p>
            <p style="margin-top:0.5rem; font-size:0.85rem; opacity:0.8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>ही वेबसाईट एक खाजगी माहितीपट आहे. शासनाशी संलग्न नाही.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-disclaimer">
        <div class="container">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation" aria-hidden="true" style="color: #fbbf24; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i>
            <strong>Disclaimer / अस्वीकरण:</strong> ही वेबसाईट महाराष्ट्र शासनाची अधिकृत वेबसाईट नाही. हा एक खाजगी माहितीपट (Informational Tool) आहे. अधिकृत माहितीसाठी शासनाच्या वेबसाईट्सला भेट द्या.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-copyright">
        <div class="container">
            &copy; 2026 MahitiMarg Information Portal. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
